{"id":"6490c20309820655","group":"91","path":"91/91-cor-FS-omega-consistency-necessity.md","title":"FS 句法一致而 ω 不一致","display":"cor-FS-omega-consistency-necessity — FS 句法一致而 ω 不一致","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-cor-FS-omega-consistency-necessity","aliases":["91-cor-FS-omega-consistency-necessity","91-cor-FS-needs-omega","91-cor-FS-consistency-condition"],"display":"cor-FS-omega-consistency-necessity — FS 句法一致而 ω 不一致","depends_on":["[[91-thm-FS-consistency]]","[[91-thm-McGee]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-cor-FS-omega-consistency-necessity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-cor-FS-omega-consistency-necessity</span><span>91-cor-FS-needs-omega</span><span>91-cor-FS-consistency-condition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-FS-omega-consistency-necessity — FS 句法一致而 ω 不一致"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ccf84662da3832c0\" href=\"?note=ccf84662da3832c0\" title=\"91-thm-FS-consistency\">91-thm-FS-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8556c1ac7447fbfa\" href=\"?note=8556c1ac7447fbfa\" title=\"91-thm-McGee\">91-thm-McGee</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FS}\">\\(\\mathrm{FS}\\)</span> 为原书全归纳经典系统，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 表示元层无矛盾证明；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\operatorname{-Con}\">\\(\\omega\\operatorname{-Con}\\)</span> 取标准实例的一致性性质。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}FS\\text{-}omega\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}necessity}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{FS})\\quad\\land\\quad\\neg\\omega\\operatorname{-Con}(\\mathrm{FS}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}FS\\text{-}omega\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}necessity}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{FS})\\quad\\land\\quad\\neg\\omega\\operatorname{-Con}(\\mathrm{FS}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一项由每个有限规则片段的标准修正模型及有限证明取得；第二项由 NEC 和弱组合条件的 McGee 见证取得。\n片段真理模型随片段变化，不能合并成一个标准 FS 模型；否则标准模型中不可能出现所证的 ω 不一致性。不能把 PA 的 ω 一致性当作 FS 一致性必要条件。</p>\n<p>来源：Corollaries 14.16–14.17，印刷页 158–159，PDF 页 169–170。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-thm-FS-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"ccf84662da3832c0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-FS-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-McGee","status":"resolved","id":"8556c1ac7447fbfa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-McGee]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{FS}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\operatorname{-Con}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}FS\\text{-}omega\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}necessity}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{FS})\\quad\\land\\quad\\neg\\omega\\operatorname{-Con}(\\mathrm{FS}).","display":true}],"bytes":1327,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-196","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-cor-FS-omega-consistency-necessity]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-196","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-cor-FS-omega-consistency-necessity]]"}],"outgoing":["ccf84662da3832c0","8556c1ac7447fbfa"]}